title: "cost-savers: token compression, context trimming, and payload sanitization for agent harnesses"
version: 0.1.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23282133"
abstract: "A suite of high-efficiency agent harness plugins and token telemetry tools: context trimming, radical blank/noise compaction, minimal system prompts, PII/secret scrubbing, request pacing, and early context gating. Measured to reduce cloud token load by over 60% on real-world long-turn sessions. Published as prior art."
authors:
  - family-names: "De Santiago"
    given-names: "Juan Carlos"
